src/text_input.rs is trimmed from GPUI's examples/input.rs (gpui-pre 0.3.11),
Copyright Zed Industries, Inc., licensed under Apache-2.0: its input handler,
text element and editing actions, cut down to one line moved by char, and
restyled with this app's theme.

The look follows Monocode Native (https://github.com/hardbeat920/monocode),
Copyright (c) 2026 Nick, licensed under MIT (full text in
assets/icons/LICENSE-MONOCODE):
- src/theme.rs takes its dark theme's surfaces, opacities, radii and sizes
  (crates/monocode-gpui/src/theme.rs, shell/layout.rs);
- src/lib.rs takes its window options: glass background, transparent title
  bar, traffic light position, minimum size (crates/monocode-gpui/src/main.rs);
- src/title_bar.rs takes its title bar and tab plate, and its tile's rim
  (theme.rs title_tab_plate, tab_tile.rs);
- src/sidebar.rs takes its section label, its detailed session row
  metrics and its "New" navigation row: the glyph, the word, the shortcut
  in its trailing column (theme.rs section_label, shell.rs,
  shell/sidebar_list.rs sidebar_navigation);
- src/filter.rs takes its header's search button: the 24 px chrome button
  at the right of the project picker, lit while the search is open
  (shell.rs sidebar-search, theme.rs chrome_button);
- src/sessions.rs takes its rails: a row's sessions hung on a line under
  it, the step and the nested row's metrics, and the state that stands in
  the time's place while the agent works (shell/rails.rs, activity.rs
  rail_from, shell.rs session_row_with and session_suffix, theme.rs
  rail_color);
- src/age.rs reimplements its relative time format and day buckets
  (crates/monocode-core/src/time.rs, shell/sidebar_list.rs);
- src/workspace.rs lays out its rounded-card frame, and paints the card's
  corners as its off-macOS fallback does (shell/layout.rs);
- src/apps.rs takes its list of editors and finds them as it does, by their
  .app bundle, the user's Applications first, opened with /usr/bin/open -a
  (crates/monocode-core/src/external_editor.rs);
- src/open_menu.rs and src/theme.rs take its popover's radius, border, shadow,
  opaque fallback fill and row metrics (popover.rs, theme.rs floating_fill);
- src/project_picker.rs takes its sidebar project header and its project
  picker: the button row, the 36 px rows with a check on the current
  project, the name and the parent folder in Menlo (pretty_parent), the
  footer entry (shell.rs, pickers.rs);
- src/login_shell.rs reimplements its login shell PATH probe: a login,
  interactive shell, a timeout, its process group killed past it
  (crates/monocode-core/src/scm/shell.rs).

